# The fixture payslips are real PDFs. Without this, git treats them as
# text and applies its CRLF filter to the binary - which shows them as
# permanently "modified" on Windows, and would substitute bytes inside
# the file on checkout for anyone cloning with core.autocrlf=true.
# Regenerating them (verify/fixtures/make_fixtures.py) would hide the
# symptom; this fixes the cause.
*.pdf binary
